      "text": [
        " \"تُكَلِّمُهَا وَ لَيْسَ هَذَا بِشَيْءٍ إِنَّمَا هَذَا وَ شِبْهُهُ مِنْ \"خُطُوٰاتِ اَلشَّيْطٰانِ\" \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4274 - Al-Ala narrated from Muhammad ibn Muslim, from one of the Imams (as), that he was asked about a woman who vowed to donate all her wealth as an offering and to set all her slaves free if she ever spoke to her sister again.\nImam (as) said: \"She may speak to her, and this (vow) is of no consequence. Indeed, this and similar actions are among the steps of Satan.\""
        ]
      }
    },
